## 7. AI-Specific Messaging Guardrails

- [ ] Do not overstate capabilities; every claim must be verifiable.
- [ ] Be transparent about AI involvement in user-facing content.
- [ ] Clearly communicate data privacy and offline/local-data handling.
- [ ] Avoid comparisons that cannot be backed by benchmarks.
- [ ] Route sensitive claims through legal review.

